201 0 obj
<</Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (SafePay architecture. Every payment, as ISO 20022 pacs.008 or pain.001, passes inline through parsing, pseudonymisation, the message model, the relationship model and policy on one IBM z17, then goes on to the recipient with the money delivered and the message shown or withheld. Cases, IBM Granite and signed evidence packs sit off the payment path. Data leaves only as the forwarded payment or a consented, signed pack.)
/P 200 0 R
/Pg 27 0 R
